{"name":"Arcane","hex":"#98687e","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"arcane","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Understood by only a few.","Obscure, mysterious."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/arcane"}],"entries":[{"title":"Anton Arcane","blocks":[{"text":"Anton Arcane is a supervillain appearing in American comic books by DC Comics. The character first appeared in Swamp Thing #2, and was created by writer Len Wein and artist Bernie Wrightson. He is the archenemy of Swamp Thing, the protagonist of the comics."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anton_Arcane"},{"title":"List of The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy characters","blocks":[{"text":"The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy is a comedy science fiction franchise created by Douglas Adams. Originally a 1978 radio comedy, it was later adapted to other formats, including novels, stage shows, comic books, a 1981 TV series, a 1984 text adventure game, and 2005 feature film. The various versions follow the same basic plot. However, in many places, they are mutually contradictory, as Adams rewrote the story substantially for each new adaptation. Throughout all versions, the series follows the adventures of Arthur Dent and his interactions with Ford Prefect, Zaphod Beeblebrox, Marvin the Paranoid Android, and Trillian."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_The_Hitchhiker's_Guide_to_the_Galaxy_characters"},{"title":"Arcane (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Arcane is an animated steampunk, action-adventure television series created by Christian Linke and Alex Yee. It was produced by the French animation studio Fortiche, under the supervision of Riot Games, and distributed by Netflix. Set in Riot's League of Legends universe, it primarily focuses on sisters Violet / \"Vi\" and Powder / Jinx as they become embroiled in a conflict between their native underbelly of Zaun and the city of Piltover. First announced at the League of Legends tenth anniversary celebration in 2019, the series' first season was released in November 2021, and a second and final season was released in November 2024."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arcane_(TV_series)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a8/ArcaneNES.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/a/a8/ArcaneNES.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Arcane as seen in the Swamp Thing video game.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AArcaneNES.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d8/God_%28Non-Existance_of%29.jpg/330px-God_%28Non-Existance_of%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/d/d8/God_%28Non-Existance_of%29.jpg/330px-God_%28Non-Existance_of%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"God, about to disappear in a puff of logic, from HitchHiker's TV series","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGod_(Non-Existance_of).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Hotblack_Desiato_estate_agents_-_February_16_2005.jpg/500px-Hotblack_Desiato_estate_agents_-_February_16_2005.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Hotblack_Desiato_estate_agents_-_February_16_2005.jpg/1280px-Hotblack_Desiato_estate_agents_-_February_16_2005.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Hotblack_Desiato_estate_agents_-_February_16_2005.jpg/500px-Hotblack_Desiato_estate_agents_-_February_16_2005.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A branch of Hotblack Desiato estate agents, after which the